        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "An employee may consent in writing to the authorization of the deduction of dues from his/her wages and to the designation of MOSES as the recipient thereof. Such consent shall be in a form acceptable to the Employer, and shall bear the signature of the employee. An employee may withdraw his/her MOSES dues check-off authorization by giving at least sixty days notice in writing to his/her department head, and by filing a copy thereof with the Treasurer of MOSES.",
